{"SystemName":"Customer.NewCustomerNote","Title":"Hesab\u0131n\u0131za Yeni Bir Not Eklendi","Content":"\u003Chtml\u003E\u003Chead\u003E\u003Cmeta charset=\u0022utf-8\u0022\u003E\u003Cmeta name=\u0022viewport\u0022 content=\u0022width=device-width, initial-scale=1\u0022\u003E\u003Cstyle type=\u0022text/css\u0022\u003Ebody{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#333;margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f7f7f7;}table{border-collapse:collapse;}td{padding:0;}.container{width:100%;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#ffffff;}.header{background-color:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;}.content{padding:30px 20px;}.footer{background-color:#f8f9fa;padding:15px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#777777;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;}.note-box{background-color:#f7f9fc;border-left:4px solid #4a89dc;padding:15px;margin:15px 0;border-radius:3px;}\u003C/style\u003E\u003C/head\u003E\u003Cbody\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022container\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022header\u0022\u003E\u003Ch2 style=\u0022color:#4a89dc;margin:0;\u0022\u003EM\u00FC\u015Fteri Hesap Bildirimi\u003C/h2\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022content\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMerhaba {{Customer.FullName}},\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHesab\u0131n\u0131za yeni bir not eklenmi\u015Ftir.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022note-box\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u0022{{Customer.NewTitleText}}\u0022\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBu not, hesab\u0131n\u0131zla ilgili \u00F6nemli bilgiler i\u00E7erebilir. Herhangi bir sorunuz olmas\u0131 durumunda, l\u00FCtfen m\u00FC\u015Fteri hizmetlerimizle ileti\u015Fime ge\u00E7mekten \u00E7ekinmeyin.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u0130yi g\u00FCnler dileriz.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022footer\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBu e-posta, {{Store.Name}} taraf\u0131ndan g\u00F6nderilmi\u015Ftir.\u003Cbr\u003E{{Store.CompanyAddress}} | {{Store.CompanyPhoneNumber}}\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E